      "worked": "Each arrow applies the sum-of-digit-squares rule. Stop when reaching $1$ or a member of the supplied loop.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}1&\\to1\\\\2&\\to4\\\\3&\\to9\\to81\\to65\\to61\\to37\\\\4&\\to16\\\\5&\\to25\\to29\\to85\\to89\\\\6&\\to36\\to45\\to41\\to17\\to50\\to25\\to29\\to85\\to89\\\\7&\\to49\\to97\\to130\\to10\\to1\\\\8&\\to64\\to52\\to29\\to85\\to89\\\\9&\\to81\\to65\\to61\\to37\\\\10&\\to1\\end{aligned}$$\n\nThus $1,7,10$ reach $1$; $2,3,4,5,6,8,9$ reach the supplied loop.",
